{"id":"797ac67bf0e1824b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/580_多主体认识逻辑_S_5_n.md","title":"580 多主体认识逻辑 S 5 n","display":"580_多主体认识逻辑_S_5_n","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a&lt;n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a&lt;n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a\\ (a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a\\ (a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,K_aA\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,K_aA\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{580}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{580})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{580}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{580})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{580}^{n}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{580}^{n}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,580}^{n}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,580}^{n}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{580})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{580})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>，替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{580,n}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{580,n}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{580,n}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{580,n}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{580,n}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{580,n}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{580,n}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{580,n}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{580,n}=\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{580,n}=\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{580,n}=\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{580,n}=\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{580,n}=\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{580,n}=\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{580,n}=\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{580,n}=\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{580}^{n}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{580,n}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{580,n}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{580,n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{580}^{n}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{580,n}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{580,n}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{580,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{580,n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{K_aA}\\ (Nec_a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{K_aA}\\ (Nec_a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{580}^{n}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n}\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n}\n\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{580}^{n}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n}\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n}\n\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{580}^{n}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{580}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\">\\(((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{580}^{n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{580}^{n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&lt;n\">\\(a&lt;n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{580}^{n}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{580}^{n}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{580}^{n}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{580}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{580}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{580}^{n}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{580}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{580}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{580}^{n}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{580}^{n}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{580}^{n}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{580}^{n}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-主体索引证书\">8. 主体索引证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"580\">\\(580\\)</span>-主体证书集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertTag}_{580}=\\{\\mathsf{T},\\mathsf{4},\\mathsf{5}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertTag}_{580}=\\{\\mathsf{T},\\mathsf{4},\\mathsf{5}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{580}^{n}={}&amp;\n\\{(a,\\mathsf{T},A,K_aA\\to A):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{4},A,K_aA\\to K_aK_aA):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{5},A,\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{580}^{n}={}&amp;\n\\{(a,\\mathsf{T},A,K_aA\\to A):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{4},A,K_aA\\to K_aK_aA):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{5},A,\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA):a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目把第 579 条的单一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个原始主体索引构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_a\">\\(K_a\\)</span>，且每个主体拥有独立的公理族和必然化规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal EpiN_{580}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{580},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{580}^{n},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n})_{a&lt;n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{last}_{580}^{n},\\vdash_{580}^{n},\\mathsf{Thm}_{580}^{n},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{580},\\mathsf{Cert}_{580}^{n}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal EpiN_{580}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{580},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{580}^{n},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{580,n},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{580,n})_{a&lt;n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{580}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{580}^{n},\n\\operatorname{last}_{580}^{n},\\vdash_{580}^{n},\\mathsf{Thm}_{580}^{n},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{580},\\mathsf{Cert}_{580}^{n}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含多主体认识逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含关系语义、公共知识或分布知识构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-主体索引证书","text":"8. 主体索引证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ag}_{580}^{n}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a<n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{580}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y